{"articleNo":"1004","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1004&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업/진로] 2009 교육역량강화사업 인성 및 직무능력검사 시행","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.12.15","hit":"11574","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009년 인성검사 및 직무능력검사 시행</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">본 검사 시험은 취업과 진로준비에 도움이 되는 중요하고 의미있는 정보를 제공합니다. 시험기준을 준수하고 진실하게 응하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 사업목적</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">:</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\"> 응시생의 취업 역량강화 및 취업 경쟁력 증대</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 검사기간 및 방법</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 검사기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 12. 14(월) 09:00 ~ 12. 31(목) 24:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 검사방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">온라인검사</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">취업정보센터 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">및</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 학교 홈페이지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">에 접속하여 검사시험에 응하시면 됩니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 검사구분 및 범위</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1학년</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp; : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">인성검사</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">(인적성 중심 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">298문항 90분)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2/3/4학년</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">직무능력검사</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #282828\">(삼성,LG,현대,STX 등 대기업 중심 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">130문항 110분)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 결과확인 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">검사즉시 본인의 결과확인 가능 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 경품시상 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 검사성적우수자 : 20명 (2010. 1. 11(월), 취업정보센터 홈페이지 시상자 발표)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 경품내용 : 삼성전자 정품USB 4G (5만원 상당)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 문의처 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;\">취업정보센터 (054-478-7211~2)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
